{
  "id": "note-from-the-author",
  "kind": "introduction",
  "sourceKind": "author-note",
  "label": "Author's Note",
  "title": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "shortTitle": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "sourceRange": [
    50,
    82
  ],
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "title": 50
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If you are reading this…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 51
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "it already means something in you stopped scrolling."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 52
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because this book is special."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 53
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But because something in it felt familiar in a way you didn’t expect."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 54
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I am not writing this as someone who has understood life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 55
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I am writing this as someone who stopped trusting the automatic explanations the mind keeps producing."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 56
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because most of what we call “understanding”…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 57
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "is actually repetition of old thoughts in new words."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 58
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And most of what we call “confusion”…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 59
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "is the moment reality stops matching the story in our head."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book is not here to give you answers."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 61
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If anything, it will do the opposite."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 62
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It will quietly interrupt the habit of turning every experience into meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 63
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because somewhere along the way…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 64
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "we stopped seeing life directly."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 65
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "We started translating it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 66
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And that translation became heavier than the thing itself."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 67
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "I am not asking you to believe anything written here."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 68
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Belief is not the point."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 69
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Observation is."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 70
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And observation is uncomfortable…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 71
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "because it removes the comfort of fixed meanings."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 72
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So if at any point this book feels too direct…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 73
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "too close…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 74
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "or too familiar…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 75
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "don’t rush to label it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 76
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Just notice it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 77
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because the intention was never to change your thinking."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 78
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It was to make you aware that thinking is already happening without your permission."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 79
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And maybe that is where the real conversation begins."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not between you and this book…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 81
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but between you and the mind that is reading it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 82
    }
  ],
  "suppressHeaderNumber": true,
  "index": 5,
  "file": "chapters/05-note-from-the-author.json"
}
